# mgk Indexer — devnet environment
#
# Copy this file to `.env` to override the defaults baked into `main.ts`.
# The indexer loads `.env` automatically via `dotenv` on startup.

# Solana JSON-RPC endpoint. Default: Solana public devnet.
# Use a paid endpoint (Helius/Triton/QuickNode) for better rate limits.
RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com

